sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Cu as Customer
  participant F as Fulfillment
  participant Co as Commerce
  participant K as Kafka
  participant P as Payment
  participant PSP as Payment provider
  Cu->>F: GET serviceability for pincode
  F-->>Cu: deliverable, estimated date
  Cu->>Co: POST /checkout (Idempotency-Key)
  Note over Co: key seen before? return the saved order<br/>revalidate price and stock<br/>ONE transaction: order, seller_orders,<br/>items with snapshots, reservations (15 min),<br/>outbox row OrderCreated
  Co-->>Cu: 201 order PAYMENT_PENDING
  Co--)K: OrderCreated
  K--)P: OrderCreated
  P->>P: create payment PENDING, provider order
  Cu->>P: pay
  P->>PSP: create payment
  PSP-->>Cu: UPI / card page
  PSP->>P: signed webhook (deduplicated)
  P->>PSP: verify status on the backend
  alt success
    Note over P: payment CAPTURED<br/>ledger entries, outbox row
    P--)K: PaymentSucceeded
    K--)Co: PaymentSucceeded
    Note over Co: order CONFIRMED, reservation CONFIRMED,<br/>stock movement, dispatch deadlines set
  else failure or timeout
    P--)K: PaymentFailed
    K--)Co: PaymentFailed
    Note over Co: order PAYMENT_FAILED,<br/>release reservation, stock movement
  end
